{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRY THE DEMO RIGHT NOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/8fe7646bb2ab0158908f12fa0006f644.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/8fe7646bb2ab0158908f12fa0006f644.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/8fe7646bb2ab0158908f12fa0006f644.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PAPER SKY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paper Sky</strong> is a <strong>stylized action-adventure</strong> where you <strong>fold, fly, and discover</strong> through a beautifully crafted world. Control a magical <strong>paper plane</strong>, unlock upgrades by <strong>reading messages left by other players</strong>, and build momentum to navigate a world full of secrets and meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick-up and easy to get back to anytime you want to play the game <strong>stress free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Sky combines the thrill of an <strong>adventure game</strong> with the mechanics of a <strong>Paper Plane simulator</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/d9ca040c68f70a37bc595f0a3152b289.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/d9ca040c68f70a37bc595f0a3152b289.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/d9ca040c68f70a37bc595f0a3152b289.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOLD YOUR PLANE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch forms on the fly; from a gliding\u00a0<strong>paper plane</strong> to a nimble\u00a0<strong>paper ball</strong>, each shape offers different movement dynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain speed, dodge obstacles, launch into the air, and master the art of <strong>precision gliding</strong> with physics-based momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/7b50b82f1eb6adf53e939c0766a325f2.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/7b50b82f1eb6adf53e939c0766a325f2.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/7b50b82f1eb6adf53e939c0766a325f2.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>READ PLAYER MESSAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the world, you\u2019ll find <strong>floating notes left by other players</strong>. <br>These aren\u2019t just messages, they\u2019re part of the gameplay. <br>Reading them <strong>unlocks new abilities</strong>, improves your <strong>aerodynamic performance</strong>, or enhances <strong>rolling and jumping mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll begin grounded, slow, and shaped by the world \u2014 and finish as a blazing paper rocket, built for the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each message is a glimpse into another journey. Use their words to write\u00a0<strong>your story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/bb3aae55d83cb9bcd8aa40c5a5da0b7b.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/bb3aae55d83cb9bcd8aa40c5a5da0b7b.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/bb3aae55d83cb9bcd8aa40c5a5da0b7b.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEMI-OPEN WORLD FLIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey a <strong>semi-open world</strong> made up of <strong>visually distinct regions</strong>, each with its own visual arts, secrets, and traversal challenges.<br>From calm meadows to windy canyons, the world shifts as you master your flight.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls &amp; tight realistic physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low pressure, high thrills</strong>: play at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized art direction</strong> across multiple themed regions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable upgrades &amp; meaningful discoveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/5b0b8ca69e8dde403ef02dd1aa132672.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/5b0b8ca69e8dde403ef02dd1aa132672.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/5b0b8ca69e8dde403ef02dd1aa132672.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1617230?t=1765558135","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765558135","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765558135","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765558135","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2936450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist &amp; Follow</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/98ce66bd8393dd2e9f149dc5b31b6de8.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRY THE DEMO RIGHT NOW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/8fe7646bb2ab0158908f12fa0006f644.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/8fe7646bb2ab0158908f12fa0006f644.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/8fe7646bb2ab0158908f12fa0006f644.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PAPER SKY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paper Sky</strong> is a <strong>stylized action-adventure</strong> where you <strong>fold, fly, and discover</strong> through a beautifully crafted world. Control a magical <strong>paper plane</strong>, unlock upgrades by <strong>reading messages left by other players</strong>, and build momentum to navigate a world full of secrets and meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick-up and easy to get back to anytime you want to play the game <strong>stress free.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paper Sky combines the thrill of an <strong>adventure game</strong> with the mechanics of a <strong>Paper Plane simulator</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/d9ca040c68f70a37bc595f0a3152b289.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/d9ca040c68f70a37bc595f0a3152b289.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/d9ca040c68f70a37bc595f0a3152b289.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOLD YOUR PLANE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch forms on the fly; from a gliding\u00a0<strong>paper plane</strong> to a nimble\u00a0<strong>paper ball</strong>, each shape offers different movement dynamics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain speed, dodge obstacles, launch into the air, and master the art of <strong>precision gliding</strong> with physics-based momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/7b50b82f1eb6adf53e939c0766a325f2.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/7b50b82f1eb6adf53e939c0766a325f2.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/7b50b82f1eb6adf53e939c0766a325f2.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>READ PLAYER MESSAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered throughout the world, you\u2019ll find <strong>floating notes left by other players</strong>. <br>These aren\u2019t just messages, they\u2019re part of the gameplay. <br>Reading them <strong>unlocks new abilities</strong>, improves your <strong>aerodynamic performance</strong>, or enhances <strong>rolling and jumping mechanics</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll begin grounded, slow, and shaped by the world \u2014 and finish as a blazing paper rocket, built for the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each message is a glimpse into another journey. Use their words to write\u00a0<strong>your story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/bb3aae55d83cb9bcd8aa40c5a5da0b7b.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/bb3aae55d83cb9bcd8aa40c5a5da0b7b.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/bb3aae55d83cb9bcd8aa40c5a5da0b7b.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEMI-OPEN WORLD FLIGHT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey a <strong>semi-open world</strong> made up of <strong>visually distinct regions</strong>, each with its own visual arts, secrets, and traversal challenges.<br>From calm meadows to windy canyons, the world shifts as you master your flight.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls &amp; tight realistic physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Low pressure, high thrills</strong>: play at your own pace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized art direction</strong> across multiple themed regions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable upgrades &amp; meaningful discoveries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/5b0b8ca69e8dde403ef02dd1aa132672.poster.avif?t=1765558135\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/5b0b8ca69e8dde403ef02dd1aa132672.webm?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1617230/extras/5b0b8ca69e8dde403ef02dd1aa132672.mp4?t=1765558135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["BRUTE FORCE"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset